        },
        {
          "text": " mbahondanise, buri muntu na mugyenzi we, abaana na baishebo. Tindikwija kubasaasira, nari okubareka, n'obu kwakuba okubagirira esaasi, ngu ntabahwerekyereza; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.",
          "type": "text",
